  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "This is a multi-center, global, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled Phase 2b study to assess the efficacy, safety, and tolerability of IMVT-1402 in adult participants with Graves' disease (GD) who are hyperthyroid despite antithyroid drug (ATD) treatment."
  },
